{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471090/extras/RoadmapSmall.png?t=1742842179\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gah! is a blend of hack'n'slash and roguelite. Choose a character, embark on an adventure, and battle monsters. Progress, upgrade your character, find items, and then... perish. But don't worry - no death is in vain; use your acquired resources to upgrade your village and unlock new characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is focused on short adventures (around one hour each), grouped into theme-related chapters. Each adventure offers a unique experience (even when replayed), thanks to procedurally generated levels and a touch of randomness in character development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Lots of characters to choose from</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the beginning of the game, you will have access to 3 base characters: King, Sorcerer, and Rogue. However, as you progress, new characters will be unlocked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each chapter allows you to unlock additional 2 playable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471090/extras/characters.png?t=1742842179\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The environment... will change</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You start in the dungeon, but soon you'll discover that objects from other worlds are beginning to enter your realm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you advance, you'll encounter enemies wielding unfamiliar weapons. Unlock playable characters who can wield these weapons themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471090/extras/weapons.png?t=1742842179\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose your path</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After each level, you'll have the opportunity to choose between two paths with different secondary objectives. Successfully completing them will reward you with additional loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Active skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each character possesses 4 unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additionally, every ability (basic, special, and auto-attack) has 4 potential upgrades (with 2 levels), and you can choose 2 upgrades per ability. Here's an example of the King's skill:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471090/extras/QSkillExampleSmaller2.png?t=1742842179\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After leveling up, you'll select 1 upgrade from a set of randomly available options. You don't have to juggle skills, you choose your set and upgrade it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Passive skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Furthermore, there are 3 passive skill trees that you can unlock by collecting orbs from defeated enemies. Each tree contains 4 levels of skills, resulting in 8-10 skills per tree. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Red skill tree (one of three):</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471090/extras/redSkillTree2.png?t=1742842179\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The primary mode of Gah! is The Adventure, where you'll embark on a campaign, unlock new NPCs, upgrades, playable characters, and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additionally, each level you complete will be unlocked for the second difficulty - The Nightmare. Completing levels on this difficulty unlocks more stuff for you :). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are also different modes that can be unlocked during the Adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have fun!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Finish first level","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2471090/c9433ebf4fa7eb047c6aaa8c0192984aeda28359.jpg"},{"name":"Finish first adventure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2471090/9f2ac6ff3860e72fb823a53304548c0519739c3b.jpg"},{"name":"Finish first chapter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2471090/495f442b27c6eccdf8594822cb8f4cbcf303d3e6.jpg"},{"name":"Finish second chapter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2471090/ebd931f9709ba3c89b081ff8f2e2294c16ea423e.jpg"},{"name":"It was inevitable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2471090/a11581c480349113e4471ddcf9dbdf7ce43b6eb6.jpg"},{"name":"Ambitious","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2471090/3cfb21f7adc23e762147a071c31842a39d3b774c.jpg"},{"name":"Eagle Eye","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2471090/bcdd82d6f62d424c0cbe614611ff817e6e377ef0.jpg"},{"name":"Hawkeye","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2471090/dd143e929c4eaab16783e799e15b4dcdda1f9335.jpg"},{"name":"Epic damage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2471090/4526529fe0303e6bc0d1d6eeb484ce87b4e97055.jpg"},{"name":"Ultrakill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2471090/8d6afc8352435b8e96a3fef1ede2387e6ff0cb1e.jpg"}],"total":36},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2471090?t=1742842179","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2471090?t=1742842179","capsule_ima