three):</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471090/extras/redSkillTree2.png?t=1742842179\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The primary mode of Gah! is The Adventure, where you'll embark on a campaign, unlock new NPCs, upgrades, playable characters, and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additionally, each level you complete will be unlocked for the second difficulty - The Nightmare. Completing levels on this difficulty unlocks more stuff for you :). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are also different modes that can be unlocked during the Adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have fun!</p>","developers":["Jasio Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471090/14bbc92577c93638ea0e79e5bb8b84c91f7124bb/header.jpg?t=1742842179","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257068178,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257068178/movie480.mp4?t=1742513960","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257068178/movie_max.mp4?t=1742513960"},"name":"Gah! Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257068178/059fcfe24df447150d89f8168c72506ff146f825/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742513960","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257068178/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742513960","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257068178/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1742513960"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257118079,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118079/movie480.mp4?t=1742841817","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118079/movie_